b-8ec0-f1ac61d39d65.pdf"},{"claim":"Profit After Tax for FY26 reached Rs. 474 million with margins of 22.7%.","quote":"Profit After Tax was Rs. 474 million, with margins of 22.7%.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-05-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=8edb66af-e031-492b-8ec0-f1ac61d39d65.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"The company is the largest manufacturer of water-soluble films in India.","quote":"Largest Manufacturer of Water Soluble Films in India","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.arrowgreentech.com/images/presentation/2026-27/AGTL%20Presentation%20Aug%202026.pdf"},{"claim":"Consistent order flow has allowed the company to maintain revenue momentum in its High-Tech segment.","quote":"While the High-Tech segment operates in a relatively mature market, we have maintained revenue momentum through consistent order flow and operational discipline.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-02-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ffc65b81-7121-4433-bd5d-6f86f8ab4643.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"Management operates with a strategy that combines financial prudence and innovation-led growth.","quote":"The Company’s strategy combines financial prudence with innovation-led growth.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-02-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ffc65b81-7121-4433-bd5d-6f86f8ab4643.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"The company faces challenges from counterfeit products in the market.","quote":"address the challenge of counterfeit products","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.arrowgreentech.com/images/presentation/2026-27/AGTL%20Presentation%20Aug%202026.pdf"},{"claim":"Forward-looking performance statements are subject to risks and uncertainties that are difficult to predict.","quote":"Such forward-looking statements are not guarantees of future performance and are subjec